{"id":"references/Topping/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09#topping-ch9-roundness-estimate","title":"topping-ch9-roundness-estimate","path":"references/Topping/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09.md","line":166,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Topping/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09.tex#topping-ch9-roundness-estimate","uses":["[[references/Topping/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09#topping-ch9-eigenvalue-convexity]]","[[references/Topping/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09#topping-ch9-ode-pde-theorem]]","[[references/Topping/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09#topping-ch9-ode-eigenvalue-system]]","[[references/Topping/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09#topping-ch9-ricci-pinching-preserved]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Topping/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09.tex","label":"topping-ch9-roundness-estimate","line":268,"source":"\\begin{theorem}\n\\label{topping-ch9-roundness-estimate}\n\\source{topping:page-0121,topping:page-0122,topping:page-0123}\n\\uses{topping-ch9-eigenvalue-convexity, topping-ch9-ode-pde-theorem, topping-ch9-ode-eigenvalue-system, topping-ch9-ricci-pinching-preserved}\n\\dcref{ch9:7.8}\n\\group{curvature-pinching}\n\nGiven \\(0<\\beta<B<\\infty\\) and \\(\\gamma>0\\), there is\n\\(M=M(\\beta,B,\\gamma)<\\infty\\) such that a Ricci flow on a closed\nthree-dimensional manifold satisfying\n\\[\n\\beta g(0)\\le\\Ric(g(0))\\le Bg(0)\n\\]\nalso satisfies\n\\[\n\\left|\\Ric-\\frac13 Rg\\right|\\le\\gamma R+M\n\\]\nfor every \\(t\\in[0,T]\\).\n\\end{theorem}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Theorem</div></section> <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-746f7070696e672d6368392d726f756e646e6573732d657374696d617465\"></span> <span class=\"tex-source\" style=\"display:block\">Source: <span class=\"reference\">topping:page-0121, topping:page-0122, topping:page-0123</span></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FTopping%2Fblueprint%2